<h1>Amex to Cathay Pacific Asia Miles Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Calculate exact Cathay Pacific Asia Miles™ received from American Express Membership Rewards® points using the official 5:4 ratio. Factors in 1,000-point blocks and oneworld redemption valuation.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  <strong>Direct Answer:</strong> US American Express Membership Rewards® transfer to Cathay Pacific Asia Miles™ at a <strong>5:4 ratio</strong> (1,000 Amex points = 800 Asia Miles, or 0.8 miles per point) in minimum increments of 1,000 points. As a foreign airline, Amex charges <strong>$0 in excise fees</strong>. Transfers are non-reversible and typically take between a few minutes and 24 hours.
</div>

